{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"diagnosis\":\"The case patterns bind only explicit constructor fields. `ParallelReduction.par` contributes two proof arguments in `cases`, and four arguments (two proofs plus two induction hypotheses) in `induction`; the damaged proof incorrectly attempted to bind implicit term indices as well.\",\"proof_body\":\"by\\n  intro a b c hab hac\\n  induction hab generalizing c with\\n  | refl =>\\n      exact ⟨c, hac, .refl c⟩\\n  | red_I =>\\n      cases hac with\\n      | refl =>\\n          exact ⟨_, .refl _, .red_I _⟩\\n      | red_I =>\\n          exact ⟨_, .refl _, .refl _⟩\\n      | par hi ha =>\\n          rw [I_irreducible _ hi]\\n          exact ⟨_, ha, .red_I _⟩\\n  | red_K _ =>\\n      cases hac with\\n      | refl =>\\n          exact ⟨_, .refl _, .red_K _ _⟩\\n      | red_K =>\\n          exact ⟨_, .refl _, .refl _⟩\\n      | par hk hb =>\\n          obtain ⟨x, hx, hk'⟩ := Ka_irreducible _ _ hk\\n          rw [hk']\\n          exact ⟨x, hx, .red_K x _⟩\\n  | red_S _ _ _ =>\\n      cases hac with\\n      | refl =>\\n          exact ⟨_, .refl _, .red_S _ _ _⟩\\n      | red_S =>\\n          exact ⟨_, .refl _, .refl _⟩\\n      | par hs hc =>\\n          obtain ⟨x, y, hx, hy, hs'⟩ := Sab_irreducible _ _ _ hs\\n          rw [hs']\\n          exact\\n            ⟨x ⬝ _ ⬝ (y ⬝ _),\\n              .par (.par hx hc) (.par hy hc),\\n              .red_S x y _⟩\\n  | par ha hb iha ihb =>\\n      cases hac with\\n      | refl =>\\n          exact ⟨_, .refl _, .par ha hb⟩\\n      | red_I =>\\n          rw [I_irreducible _ ha]\\n          exact ⟨_, .red_I _, hb⟩\\n      | red_K =>\\n          obtain ⟨x, hx, ha'⟩ := Ka_irreducible _ _ ha\\n          rw [ha']\\n          exact ⟨x, .red_K x _, hx⟩\\n      | red_S _ _ =>\\n          obtain ⟨x, y, hx, hy, ha'⟩ := Sab_irreducible _ _ _ ha\\n          rw [ha']\\n          exact\\n            ⟨x ⬝ _ ⬝ (y ⬝ _),\\n              .red_S x y _,\\n              .par (.par hx hb) (.par hy hb)⟩\\n      | par hc hd =>\\n          obtain ⟨x, hx₁, hx₂⟩ := iha hc\\n          obtain ⟨y, hy₁, hy₂⟩ := ihb hd\\n          exact ⟨x ⬝ y, .par hx₁ hy₁, .par hx₂ hy₂⟩\"}"}}
